    "id": "AUc_HgCWJABm"
   },
   "source": [
    "- We highlight the following quality criteria that we assessed (among others) to determine the suitability of the dataset for our task:\n",
    "\n",
    "- In terms of completeness, the dataset satisfies our requirement, as it is quite extensive and broad. Has extensive data to work with, everyday from early 1950s to 2023 and includes 216 countries, which thus shows variety.\n",
    "\n",
    "- The dataset has a few attributes that have too many null values, but these attributes in question are the ones that are not essential in our analysis. We can either replace these null values with the averages if fitting, otherwise we can remove them from our dataset.\n",
    "\n",
    "- The dataset is taken from Kaggle and the source of the dataset is from Meteostat. Both of which are reputable and therefore we need not worry about erronous data.\n",
    "\n",
    "- The dataset is relevant for our analysis."
