  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "0gujI5cxJABm"
   },
   "source": [
    "**Conclusion**\n",
    "\n",
    "From our data exploration, we consider our dataset suitable for use/analysis, with the following caveats in mind:\n",
    "\n",
    "Locations may exhibit an overrepresentation of some climate zones, which may need to be countered by appropriate sampling of the training data.\n",
    "\n",
    "Weather data has some NULL values. We will consider using them for our analysis if we can find ways to include them. However, we note that as of now, we can only consider temperature and precipitation data, which is already enough for our analysis.\n",
    "\n",
    "The dataset has seasons. We note that some regions have seasonal weather while others don't, so this might cause some discrepancies in our analysis. best to keep it at 1 season that most of the world has, e.g summer.\n"
