  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We see that Argiculture, Solvents, and Waste use only `process` fuel, while Residential and Transporation are vice versa. Every fuel each sector uses have records for every year. When sum everything up, we see that our data is complete in term of required combinations of fuel and sector."
