    "    - 1A2b_Ind-Comb-Non-ferrous-metals (c)\n",
    "    - 1A2c_Ind-Comb-Chemicals (c)\n",
    "    - 1A2d_Ind-Comb-Pulp-paper (c)\n",
    "    - 1A2e_Ind-Comb-Food-tobacco (c)\n",
    "    - 1A2f_Ind-Comb-Non-metallic-minerals (c)\n",
    "    - 1A2g_Ind-Comb-Construction (c)\n",
