    "From the above data(heatmap_data), it is seen that CO2 emissions are measured in very large quantities, hence with raw data, heatmap plotting would not be significant to show the differences in the emissions of the CO2 gas. Hence, we would conduct a Min-Max Normalisation to convert the scale from millions to 0-1."
