  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We now want to analyse by eras, so we can find out which eras have the highest emissions and contributed to warming the most. Additionally, we also want to verify that every major economic and policy shift in different time periods left a significant/detectable impact on the data we observe.\n",
    "\n",
